   "part": 1,
   "pin": null,
   "question": "",
   "quote": "Encode() asserts on an empty key, which is what DecodeExtKey leaves you with when it fails, and that's the value bip32_tests compares. I broke the decode to see. The case dies on SIGABRT and takes the",
