    "id": "rc:3889310585",
    "quote": "Yes, that's what I meant. I broke the decode again and now it prints CExtKey(<invalid>) and the suite finishes, no SIGAB"
   },
   "status_note": "Fix verified by reviewer",
   "type": "objection",
